# The quick menu before the flight (mode QuickGround).
#
# Locations 1 to 15 are ranks in the framed block of the style
# "Dynamic": 1 is the centre, where the focus starts, 2 above, 3 left,
# 4 right, 5 below, 6 two above, 7 two below, 8 and 9 the upper
# corners, 10 and 11 beside 2, 12 and 13 beside 5, 14 and 15 the lower
# corners:
#
#    8   6   9
#   10   2  11
#    3   1   4
#   12   5  13
#   14   7  15
#
# 8 to 10 stay empty for now; the list can grow.

